- **Ratings and counts:** Cael remains fifteen, Assessed-Copper, with three partial fragments. Lira's entry is exactly `Provisional Iron-equivalent. One of two.` The correction chain moves neither Cael nor Lira. Vell's four dependent corrections are carried through the four affected fighters.
